00:14:23.120 --> 00:14:28.080
there was only one problem while everyone was&nbsp;
convinced that a northwest passage existed&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:28.080 --> 00:14:31.600
no one had ever actually found it the&nbsp;
passage was so important to the king&nbsp;&nbsp;

