second ship hms discovery replacing the adventure&nbsp;
cook departed from great britain in july 1776.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:59.280 --> 00:15:04.640
no one knew it at the time but the sea captain&nbsp;
would never see his homeland or his family again

00:15:09.840 --> 00:15:14.560
the official purpose of cook's voyage was to&nbsp;
return amay a polynesian man who had been taken to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:14.560 --> 00:15:19.600
europe during cook's last journey back to his home&nbsp;
in tahiti once this was done cook could turn his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:19.600 --> 00:15:24.880
attention to his actual objective the northwest&nbsp;
passage in december 1777 cook left tahiti and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:24.880 --> 00:15:29.760
headed north making for the california coastline&nbsp;
it was during this trip that he first came across&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:29.760 --> 00:15:34.080
the island in the middle of the pacific that no&nbsp;
european had ever seen before he had discovered&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:34.080 --> 00:15:39.840
the northernmost hawaiian islands cook spent most&nbsp;
of the rest of 1778 trying to find the northwest&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:39.840 --> 00:15:44.800
passage sailing through the bering strait and&nbsp;
