00:16:04.720 --> 00:16:09.200
months resolution and discovery dropped anchor&nbsp;
on the southwestern coast of hawaii by pure&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:09.200 --> 00:16:14.080
chance cook's arrival coincided with the native&nbsp;
hawaiian harvest festival celebrating lono the god&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:14.080 --> 00:16:18.480
of the harvest there is some speculation that the&nbsp;
