00:16:18.480 --> 00:16:23.120
lono there to visit them which would explain the&nbsp;
initial excitement surrounding his visit before&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:23.120 --> 00:16:27.520
long however relations between cook's crew and&nbsp;
