00:16:37.120 --> 00:16:41.760
the resolution broke off and cook returned to&nbsp;
the bay for repairs for the hawaiians this was&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:41.760 --> 00:16:49.840
an unexpected and unwelcome surprise and it set&nbsp;
off a chain of events that would end in violence

00:16:51.920 --> 00:16:56.800
on all three of his trips cook had to deal with&nbsp;
native polynesians and malanesians stealing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:56.800 --> 00:17:00.720
things from his crew he did not understand that&nbsp;
the natives had a very different definition of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:00.720 --> 00:17:04.880
property than the europeans and felt that&nbsp;
since cook's ships had so much extra stuff&nbsp;&nbsp;

