thievery by the natives during a three-month stay&nbsp;
in tonga cook adored dozens of natives lashed and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:27.920 --> 00:17:32.240
when that didn't work he started cutting off ears&nbsp;
shooting natives and then forcing them to try and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:32.240 --> 00:17:38.160
swim to shore beating them with boat ors and other&nbsp;
blunt objects and in at least one case he had a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:38.160 --> 00:17:43.920
cross cut into a man's arm going all the way down&nbsp;
to the bone many of cook's crew were veterans of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:43.920 --> 00:17:48.240
his previous voyage and was shocked by his marked&nbsp;
