00:18:32.640 --> 00:18:37.120
rode ashore with the ship's detachment of raw&nbsp;
marines in tow and set out for the chief's hut&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:37.120 --> 00:18:41.120
the chief was still asleep when he was awakened&nbsp;
by cook and politely asked to accompany him back&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:41.120 --> 00:18:45.200
to his ship believing that he was being asked&nbsp;
