00:19:14.160 --> 00:19:18.160
his way with the natives he'd encountered on&nbsp;
his adventures that he made the fatal decision&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:18.160 --> 00:19:23.520
to persist with his intimidation tactics no one&nbsp;
