00:19:36.880 --> 00:19:41.520
metal dagger ironically given to the hawaiians as&nbsp;
gift weeks earlier as the remaining marines fled&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:41.520 --> 00:19:46.320
for their lives and the two ships started firing&nbsp;
on the crowd with their cannons the hawaiians took&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:46.320 --> 00:19:50.960
turns stabbing cook's body over and over again&nbsp;
they passed the dagger from one person to another&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:50.960 --> 00:19:56.080
each getting a turn to plunge it into his flesh&nbsp;
cook was dead long before they finally ceased

00:20:01.200 --> 00:20:05.360
cook's body was dragged off the beach and placed&nbsp;
in a roasting pit until his flesh had been&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:05.360 --> 00:20:10.080
cooked off his bones they were pulled out and&nbsp;
buried in secret caves all over the islands&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:10.080 --> 00:20:13.840
four of the most powerful chiefs ate&nbsp;
cook's heart to absorb his manner&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:13.840 --> 00:20:17.360
his power the only bits of the captain's&nbsp;
body recovered by the crew of the resolution&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:17.360 --> 00:20:21.840
were his hands and part of his skull which&nbsp;
